      "writtenOn": "2017-05-24T01:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Peter,\n\nIt based on requirement mentioned in GSMA.\n\nhttp://www.gsma.com/newsroom/all-documents/ts-22-v-5-0-recommendations-for-minimum-wi-fi-capabilities-of-terminals/\n\nTSG22_R2_CM_20\n\nA device SHALL limit the number of access retries to the same AP when it receives temporary denied access notification from that AP, according to a limit which may be defined by an operator. (e.g. 1026 notification with EAPSIM in RFC 4186 [RFC 4186])",
      "parentUuid": "0d409c43_4a021487",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4151,
        "startChar": 16,
